  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Skills Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFAT has been supporting skills development in Tonga through the delivery of a Certificate in Technical and Vocational skills (CITVS) in secondary schools. This Activity would expand the reach and coverage of CITVS at secondary schools to include new subjects, providers and students, especially in the outer islands.</narrative>
  </description>
